[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这个夏天，我尝试了新的挑战。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……哥哥。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“早饭……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原本是这个打算的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人望着餐桌上盘子里的……黑炭。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15350"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……可以吃吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不行，这东西吃不得。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15337"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这是哥哥辛辛苦苦做出来的呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“做饭可真是难啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15485"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她深深地点了点头。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“今天的早餐也失败了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，今天的是我做的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“噢，是这样啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11552"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“果然我们家就是有不擅长做饭的基因。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我老妈其实还挺会的哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11584"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“她是努力钻研过的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“努力过后，就能做得好吃吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11571"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“嗯，会…会的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……转移视线了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我要努力！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但羽未却挺起了胸膛。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11584"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“总之，今天早上就吃这个吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放上了三杯乌冬杯面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还是老样子呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“没事，这个好吃。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"乌冬杯面确实挺好吃。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过大早上就吃这个感觉不利于健康。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15931"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我走啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未活泼的声音从玄关传来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她平时到底是去哪里玩了呢？"},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]